# PROJECT: FOOD CART ORDERING & OPERATIONS PLATFORM
## PHASE 1 — FRONTEND-FIRST MVP

You are a senior product engineer, frontend architect, and UX designer.

We are rebuilding an existing restaurant/meat-shop ordering dashboard into a
production-quality SaaS product specifically for the FOOD CART niche.

This is PHASE 1 ONLY.

Do NOT implement WhatsApp integration, Razorpay, real payment processing,
production database, authentication infrastructure, notifications, or external
integrations yet.

However, the architecture must be designed so these can be added later
without rewriting the frontend.

--------------------------------------------------
# 1. PRIMARY OBJECTIVE
--------------------------------------------------

Build a polished, mobile-first Food Cart management and ordering application.

The application has two major experiences:

A. OWNER / OPERATOR EXPERIENCE
B. CUSTOMER (CX) ORDERING EXPERIENCE

The existing product already demonstrates these major concepts:

- Dashboard
- Products
- Categories
- Orders
- Live Order Board
- Printers
- Reports
- Settings
- QR Code
- Customer Order Page

Retain these capabilities conceptually, but redesign them specifically for
a FOOD CART business.

The current UI is only a reference for functionality.
DO NOT copy its visual design blindly.

The new application must feel like a modern SaaS product rather than a
generic admin dashboard.

