# 3. CORE PHASE 1 WORKFLOW
--------------------------------------------------

This workflow MUST work end-to-end.

CUSTOMER:

1. Customer scans the QR code displayed by the owner.
2. Customer opens the Food Cart customer ordering page.
3. Customer sees the configured menu/products.
4. Customer selects quantities.
5. Customer reviews the cart.
6. Customer clicks "Pay Now".
7. THERE IS NO REAL PAYMENT IMPLEMENTATION IN PHASE 1.
8. Treat "Pay Now" as a simulated checkout action.
9. The order is immediately created.
10. Customer sees an order confirmation/order number.

OWNER:

11. The newly created order appears in LIVE ORDER BOARD.
12. Order initially enters:

    NEW

13. Owner moves the order through:

    NEW
      ↓
    ACCEPTED
      ↓
    PREPARING
      ↓
    READY
      ↓
    COMPLETED

14. Once COMPLETED:
    - remove it from the active Live Order Board
    - place it into Order History
    - update dashboard/report statistics

This workflow must actually function in Phase 1.

Do not build static demo cards that merely look functional.

