--------------------------------------------------

COPY LINK:

Copies the generated customer ordering URL.

DOWNLOAD QR:

Downloads the generated QR image.

PRINT POSTER:

Opens a print-friendly layout containing:

Food Cart name
"Scan to Order"
QR code
Customer ordering URL
Optional Tamil instruction:

"QR-ஐ Scan செய்து Order செய்யுங்கள்"

The printed QR must remain functional after printing.

