# 25. ORDER CREATION
--------------------------------------------------

When customer clicks "Pay Now":

createOrder()

must:

1. Validate cart
2. Validate product availability
3. Calculate totals from product prices
4. Create order ID
5. Generate human-readable order number
6. Set status = NEW
7. Set payment status appropriately for Phase 1
8. Persist order
9. Make order immediately visible to Live Order Board
10. Clear customer cart
11. Show confirmation

Never trust totals calculated only by the UI.

Use a reusable order calculation/domain function.

